      "text": "[ PASSOFF- 084 ]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(Watching TV/Go to bed)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "After dinner, our family watches TV together."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "My mother doesn’t allow us to watch a lot of TV."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I like the entertainment programs because I can see famous"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "actors and musicians."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "After I finish watching TV, I do a little review to prepare for school,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "write in my journal, and then go to bed."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Even though my days are filled with many activities,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "they are a lot of fun too."
    },
